ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp108: EDGE_CURVE with 3D LINE spanning parameter [-1, 6] (via oversized vector); PCURVE B-spline knot domain [0, 5]; edge parametrization [-1, 6] extends outside pcurve's valid domain; CheckPCurveRange must detect and report out-of-domain evaluation; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
